      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ch02 machine learning systems design\n    - frame business problems as machine learning solutions\n        - familarity with common practices, usecases\n    - prioritize business ROI not arbitrary model performance without impact\n    - most deployed models are classical machine learning models\n        - in reality, hybrid approach and multimodal to use relevant models as tools when needed",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ch02 machine learning systems design\n    - frame business problems as machine learning solutions\n        - familarity with common practices, usecases\n    - prioritize business ROI not arbitrary model performance without impact\n    - most deployed models are classical machine learning models\n        - in reality, hybrid approach and multimodal to use relevant models as tools when needed",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "PeL7wNi-db7ApZuMivVjh",
      "type": "text",
