      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785261806979,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Takeaways\n    - could mean various things, get clarity on:\n        - online\n            - human intervention > on the internet\n        - offline\n            - no human intervention > \n        - production\n            - notebook to stakeholders vs. serving >1M users\n\n    - main 4 non-functional characteristics for most Machine learning systems\n        1. reliability\n            - machine learning systems can fail silently\n\n        2. scalability\n            - compute\n\n        3. maintainability\n            - people from various backgrounds, so find a mutually collective and comphrensive ecosystem\n            - code should be documented\n            - code, data, artifact should be versioned\n\n        4.  adaptability\n            - iterative process, continuous improvement & learning",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Takeaways\n    - could mean various things, get clarity on:\n        - online\n            - human intervention > on the internet\n        - offline\n            - no human intervention > \n        - production\n            - notebook to stakeholders vs. serving >1M users\n\n    - main 4 non-functional characteristics for most Machine learning systems\n        1. reliability\n            - machine learning systems can fail silently\n\n        2. scalability\n            - compute\n\n        3. maintainability\n            - people from various backgrounds, so find a mutually collective and comphrensive ecosystem\n            - code should be documented\n            - code, data, artifact should be versioned\n\n        4.  adaptability\n            - iterative process, continuous improvement & learning",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "t-eRuseG1kGePyEsZfStk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -4287.572136374061,
      "y": 8280.356212799197,
      "width": 772.00146484375,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "N_7VHjFYCuz-m-bbYgyMX",
      "index": "Zzx",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2077642976,
      "version": 637,
      "versionNonce": 1487981501,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785262551456,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "'The process of updating a model is manual and ad hoc. Someone, usually a\ndata engineer, has to query the data warehouse for new data. Someone else\ncleans this new data, extracts features from it, retrains that model from\nscratch on both the old and new data, and then exports the updated model\ninto a binary format. Then someone else takes that binary format and deploys\nthe updated model. Oftentimes, the code encapsulating data, features, and\nmodel logic was changed during the retraining process but these changes failed\nto be replicated to production, causing bugs that are hard to track down.'",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "'The process of updating a model is manual and ad hoc. Someone, usually a data engineer, has to query the data warehouse for new data. Someone else cleans this new data, extracts features from it, retrains that model from scratch on both the old and new data, and then exports the updated model into a binary format. Then someone else takes that binary format and deploys the updated model. Oftentimes, the code encapsulating data, features, and model logic was changed during the retraining process but these changes failed to be replicated to production, causing bugs that are hard to track down.'",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
