      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785261806979,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ch04 training data\n    - sampling, labels, class imbalance (skewed distribution), data augmentation)\n    * fundamentals of evaluation metrics\n        - precision, recall, F1, accuracy, area under the curve, precision-recall curve\n    - feature engineering: choosing what data to use and what to extract for the machine learning model\n        ?) deep learning is still hands-on despite marketed as not having to be; more like feature extraction for higher dimension patterns\n        - feature extraction may require a domain expert to identify value-add features",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ch04 training data\n    - sampling, labels, class imbalance (skewed distribution), data augmentation)\n    * fundamentals of evaluation metrics\n        - precision, recall, F1, accuracy, area under the curve, precision-recall curve\n    - feature engineering: choosing what data to use and what to extract for the machine learning model\n        ?) deep learning is still hands-on despite marketed as not having to be; more like feature extraction for higher dimension patterns\n        - feature extraction may require a domain expert to identify value-add features",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "pmDK0G9Reh9lOOMUZqRhc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -5930.126287464558,
      "y": 6833.6594705203215,
      "width": 642.6195678710938,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
