      "seed": 1802528080,
      "version": 1129,
      "versionNonce": 1835877683,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785262543454,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ch05  feature engineering\n    - quality > quantity\n    - having too many features can be bad to training and serving:\n        - leaky data features\n        - overfitting\n        - increased compute, latency\n        - excess features become technical debt\n            - more effective to remove than linger features >0",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ch05  feature engineering\n    - quality > quantity\n    - having too many features can be bad to training and serving:\n        - leaky data features\n        - overfitting\n        - increased compute, latency\n        - excess features become technical debt\n            - more effective to remove than linger features >0",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "49PHK1qMPGnxWiPIm2y9x",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -5936.812710749024,
      "y": 7055.165648293817,
      "width": 922.6195068359375,
      "height": 500,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "N_7VHjFYCuz-m-bbYgyMX",
      "index": "a4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1308677456,
      "version": 1973,
      "versionNonce": 1591417725,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785262543454,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ch06  model development and offline evaluation\n    - with initial features to develop algorthims and evaluate before deployment\n    - a iterative process to continuously improve and learn\n    ** focus on algorithms based on the problem you're trying to solve **\n        - text classificaiton: natural language processing, NLP: BERT, LLM?\n    - evaluations and assessment:\n        - model performance: accuracy, precision, F1, loss\n        - other properties: data, compute, time/memory, inference latency\n\n    - 6 tips for model selection\n        1. avoid state of the art trap: evaluate for the business, simpler & cheaper is preferred\n        2. start with the simplest model\n        3. avoid human biases in selecting models\n        4. evaluate good performance now (design for today's problems)\n        5. evaluate trade-offs\n        6. understand your model\n            - data, assumptions, limitations, distributions, features and drift\n\n    - bagging & boosting, essembles, stacking\n    - experiment tracking and versioning",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ch06  model development and offline evaluation\n    - with initial features to develop algorthims and evaluate before deployment\n    - a iterative process to continuously improve and learn\n    ** focus on algorithms based on the problem you're trying to solve **\n        - text classificaiton: natural language processing, NLP: BERT, LLM?\n    - evaluations and assessment:\n        - model performance: accuracy, precision, F1, loss\n        - other properties: data, compute, time/memory, inference latency\n\n    - 6 tips for model selection\n        1. avoid state of the art trap: evaluate for the business, simpler & cheaper is preferred\n        2. start with the simplest model\n        3. avoid human biases in selecting models\n        4. evaluate good performance now (design for today's problems)\n        5. evaluate trade-offs\n        6. understand your model\n            - data, assumptions, limitations, distributions, features and drift\n\n    - bagging & boosting, essembles, stacking\n    - experiment tracking and versioning",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
